aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.speaker=Snowball Merchant
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.main_hub.body=Want a snowball fight? Join a team for free, then start when you are ready. Snowballs you already have are taken when the fight starts so everyone starts even. Grab more from the piles. Townsfolk fill empty spots. The winning team gets winter festival tickets when the fight ends.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.main_hub.c_join=Join the fight
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.main_hub.c_leave=Leave the fight
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.main_hub.c_start=Start the fight
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.main_hub.c_busy=A fight is already going
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.main_hub.c_collect=Collect my tickets
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.main_hub.c_shop=See holiday goods
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.main_hub.c_scoreboard=Look at the scoreboard
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.main_hub.c_about=How does the fight work?
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.main_hub.c_goodbye=Goodbye

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.about.body=Join for free, then start when everyone is ready. Snowballs you already have are taken when the fight starts so everyone starts even. You move to a team pad. Each person has three snowflakes. A hit from the other team takes one. When you have none left you sit out. The fight lasts four minutes, or ends when one team is fully out. The team with more snowflakes left wins. A tie gives both teams tickets. Winners get five winter festival tickets when the fight ends.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.about.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.joined.body=You are in! Tell me when you want to start, or wait for friends to join.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.joined.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.join_failed.body=I cannot add you right now. The fight may be full or already going.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.join_failed.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.left.body=You left the fight. Come back when you are ready.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.left.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.start_failed.body=I cannot start yet. Join first, and we need at least two people including townsfolk.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.start_failed.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.fight_busy.body=A fight is already going. Wait until it ends, then you can join the next one.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.fight_busy.c_back=Back

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.collect_win.body=Nice throwing! Here are {count} winter festival tickets. Spend them on holiday goods.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.collect_win.c_back=Thanks

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.collect_none.body=I do not have any tickets waiting for you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_snowball_merchant.collect_none.c_back=Back
